desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Libxml Backend"
	title_zh: "Libxml Backend"
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-libxml-backend"
	risk: "xxe"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
This application is using LibXML as the XML backend. LibXML can be vulnerable to XML External Entities (XXE) vulnerabilities. Use the built-in Rails XML parser, REXML, instead.

### 风险类型
XML 外部实体注入（XXE）（xxe）

### 影响
解析不可信 XML 时允许外部实体，可能读取本地文件或发起 SSRF。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 补充说明
Note: source-mode regex approximation of a safe-literal pattern.

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-611: Improper Restriction of XML External Entity Reference
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
禁用外部实体和 DTD，使用安全的 XML 解析配置。

推荐修复：
Use the built-in Rails XML parser, REXML, instead.
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.rb": <<<POS
ActiveSupport::XmlMini.backend = "LibXML"
POS
	"safefile://pos.rb": <<<NEG
ActiveSupport::XmlMini.backend = "Nokogiri"
NEG
)

${*.rb}.pattern_regex(/(?:ActiveSupport::XmlMini\.backend\s+=\s+"LibXML")/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Libxml Backend",
	title_zh: "Libxml Backend",
	message: "Libxml Backend detected.",
}
